cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "BioEvidence Forge: offline-first biomedical evidence monitoring and review service"
abstract: "A self-hosted service that continuously collects open biomedical literature from PubMed for configured research topics, stores records with full provenance in a local SQLite archive, scores relevance transparently and produces citation-complete Markdown evidence briefs for human review. Designed to fail safely, respect public API policies and run without cloud services or GPUs."
authors:
